``` Network Infrastructure```
| tstats count where index=dns sourcetype=infoblox:dhcp
| eval m2131_code="4.1"
| inputlookup append=t m2131_comp.csv  
| stats max(*) as * by m2131_code
| eval count=if(isnull(events),count,events)
| fields - events
| outputlookup m2131_comp.csv


| tstats count where index=cisco sourcetype="cisco:wlc"
| eval m2131_code="7.1"
| inputlookup append=t m2131_comp.csv  
| stats max(*) as * by m2131_code
